  m_text: "Yo man, I've heard you been playin the new MTX Sim. \nIt comes preinstalled
    with every new pc I think, I also had it on my new one. I don't know what its
    about much but you have to pay some big bucks to access anything. but I heard
    it's worth.\n\nI dont have a job rn but when I need some quick paper for the
    skins I usually go for SurvAyy or GaymTester. Theyre free so you dont even have
    to spend nothing on it. And you can earn good green if you tryhard.\n\noh and
    you HAVE TO buy the bank widget thingy. costs a bit but you can always see your
    cash so you know if you can afford a skin.  l8rs "
