  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Hi honey, how is your new home? I hope you are eating well and you are
    not always on that computer. We are doing good here, but it's kinda empty since
    you left, haha. \n\nMy friend told me you can now earn money through computer
    or by buying some computer coins? so I thought maybe I should let you know, but
    you probably know this already, don't you haha. You are a smart kid so you shouldn't
    have problem finding job in your field, even if you have to sit in front of that
    computer all the time. Money is important, but so is health, remember.\n\nCall
    us when you have some free time. Love you honey."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0fa9194d9df0fd42a2638438732bb62, type: 2}
