  descriptions:
  - Lonely wanderer through this lonely world
  - A fine ass person who doesn't sway away from any type of contact. Very clingy,
    loyal and devoted. Please just somebody text me. Please
  - If you don't like me at my best, you don't deserve me at my worst. I dislike
    many things and like very few things. But you may be one of these few things.
    Shoot.
  - Don't you just hate it when you spend so much time making the right profile but
    ultimately meeting the worst kind of person and all that just goes away? No?
    Well then I might be a match for you.
  - I am just trying to find someone cool who will accept me for who i am and maybe
    once in a while go out grab a beer
  - What would life be without other people? can we call it life? what makes a life
    if not two oeple combined? i am looking for that second person to make our lives
    a bit better in this grey world.
  - swipe right. you don't even have to think twice.
  - if you won't care for me like i am your newest car, you can swipe left.
  - looking for someone strong yet sensitive. for someone small yet big. for someone
    cold yet warm. someone up yet down. someone yes yet no. someone in yet out.
  - if you won't text first swipe left
  - 6/10 looks, 12/10 personality, 8/10 interests, 4/10 charisma, 100/10 ideal match
  - "Here for love, chaos, and the person who won\u2019t judge me for ordering dessert
    before dinner. Or two. Or three."
  - "Part hopeless romantic, part golden retriever energy. I\u2019m here for someone
    who wants cute dates, late-night talks, and maybe a little bit of chaos."
  - "I live for beautiful views, good food, and someone who can match my energy -
    which ranges from \u2018let\u2019s travel the world\u2019 to \u2018let\u2019s
    stay in bed all day.\u2019"
  - "I don\u2019t take myself too seriously, except when it comes to treating someone
    right. If you enjoy random adventures, warm cuddles, and being adored just a
    little too much, we\u2019ll get along."
  - "I\u2019m here for someone who wants connection. Real, fun, flirty connection."
  - Lookig for that serios relation type shi.
  - 'Look me in the eyes and tell me you are the person for me. Then convince me
    that you are telling the truth. '
  - Half-super, half-wonder. Or was it half-super and half-man? Whatever the case,
    you best believe I am as super as I am human. Which is 100% in this case.
  - The moon landing was fake. Swipe left if you live in a lie and still believe
    the earth is a ball XD.
