  - games
  - color
  - music
  - dance
  - clothes
  - drink
  - sweet
  - pet
  - sport
  - books
  - travel
  - country
  - career
  - education
  - hobbies
  - interests
  - technology
  - lifestyle
  - fun
  - activities
  - random question
  - social
  - money
  - skills
  - style
  - art
  - nature
  - thunder
  playerResponses:
  - so... what kind of food do you like?
  - do you have any favorite animals? and I don't mean pets, animals overall
  - you playing any video games at the moment?
  - okay here goes... what is your favorite color?
  - what kind of music do you like to listen to? if any at all
  - okay how good of a dancer are you? something tells me you might be an amazing
    dancer
  - you've got a pretty cool style from the photos I saw on your profile. is that
    how you look everyday?
  - since you're an adult i've got an adult question for you... favourite drink?
  - such a sweet person like you must get it from somewhere. what's your best snack?
  - you got any pets?
  - It's hard to see through the picture, but do you do any kind of sport?
  - do yo do any reading in your free time? i love a good book from time to time.
  - what is your view on travelling? i've always wanted to see as much of the world.
  - so i know it doesnt show up in the profile, but wanted to ask which country are
    you from?
  - a person of so many different interests has to have an equally interesting job.
    what do you do?
  - 'so... were you good at school and stuff or mostly skipped classes? '
  - you've got so many different interests... any on these is your hobby in particular?
  - what interests you the most in life? or in general. and i'm not talking about
    hobbies here.
  - how good are you with technology? do you follow it by chance? it's growing pretty
    fast nowadays...
  - what kind of lifestyle do you lead? myself i'm pretty casual. not too formal
    but not too clunky either.
  - so whatcha do for fun? i'm not accepting movies or books as an answer.
  - any activities in particular you'd like to share with me? or maybe invite me
    while we're at it hehe
  - do you like cheese?
  - since we're both here am I correct to assume you're not very sociable person?
  - what is your favorite thing to spend money on?
  - 'do you have any special skills or secret talents? i can go first: i am double
    jointed.'
  - you've got a pretty... unique style. can i ask you to explain a bit more about
    how you carry yourself?
  - are you keen on art perhaps? paintings, movies, books, games, drawings, you name
    it
  - do you enjoy taking a walk surrounded by nature? i love the smell of freshly
    cut grass and forest.
  - so what made you create an account here? i won't say it was pure desperation
    on my behalf.
  npcResponses:
  - are you suggesting something? ...anyways i like a good healthy burger
  - oh you bet, i love horses, pandas and dogs. everything fluffy or... big.
  - yeah i've been playing flower defense for a good while now but i'm not very good
    at it :/
  - well we had to do it sooner or later. it's white and black. equally favourite.
  - what would life be without music? It's dull to say 'everything' but I guess whatever
    catches my ear is my go-to song
  - is that so? I did have some dancing classes in elementary school, but that's
    about it. Sorry to burst your dancing dream.
  - oh god, no. they were made specifically for the profile. I'd say most of the
    days I prefer something loose and comfy.
  - drink? as in cocktail? there are so many i struggle to come up with just one.
    lets say... cuba libre.
  - is that right? hmmmm... does strawberry ice cream count? I guess anything strawbery
    flavoured.
  - i couldn't live without my pets i'll let you know. and they come before everything
    else, so... you know...
  - yeah it's not very clear in the photo, but i do! i occasionally go for a quick
    jog. I take a lot of walks. it's not much really, but keeps me in shape.
  - oh me too, i mostly read just before going to bed. i think fantasy is my favourite
    genre, but from time to time i like to read something scientific.
  - of course, who wouldn't? my goal is to visit at least 20 different countries
    in my life. for now i am trying to afford the travel cost.
  - 'i won''t say precisely where i''m from... but i can give you a hint: northern-eastern
    hemisphere'
  - yours too! my work is mostly done remotely. i... help people in need. and we'll
    leave it at that.
  - of course i was a good student. if i wasn't i would probably end up in a ditch
    right about now.
  - not particularly these listed on my profile, but if we meet up i can tell you
    all about it. it's not something worth spoiling over text ;)
  - i dont really know, i never thought about it seriously. i guess i don't have
    any special interests other than what i do daily.
  - these days you got to be good with technology, no? you can guess just how good
    i am since i managed to make a profile here all by myself.
  - my lifestyle depends on where i am at the moment. i try to keep my house clean
    and tidy if that's what you mean, but i can let loose once in a while
  - if i'm not doing any of the interests listed on my profile i probably go somewhere
    with my friends or am busy working.
  - activities... i can't seem to come up with anything smart. everyone likes a good
    rollercoaster or a movie in the cinema, no? i guess anything classic.
  - i love cheesy chips if that counts.
  - quite the opposite actually, i created this profile to meet someone so i'd say
    i consider myself an extravert
  - food. clothes. beer.
  - that's something you should put in your profile! i can name all us states with
    letter 'Q' in them in less than 3 seconds.
  - the way you see me is the way i am. nothing more nothing less.
  - not more, nor less than the next person. i can respect a good piece of art, but
    i wouldn't drool over anything in particular
  - it's nice from time to time, but can be quite repetetive and boring if done too
    many times. i like variety, so a bit of this and a bit of that works for me
  - well i am hoping to finally meet someone worth my time. we'll see if that works
    out...
  chatContentParent: {fileID: 1164266806}
