  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Bunk Bank is the leading corporation in finanse, banking, income and expenses
    management, currency monitoring, market collaboration and many many more. The
    history reaches far back to the XII century when the very first Bunk Bank was
    created in ancient Europe. The bank was as successful as it is nowadays and the
    quality remained the same ever since. The original founder is unknown yet here
    in Bunk Bank we believe in equality and equity. That''s why it''s not important
    to us who started it, but rather who is leading it. And that''s you! We put our
    full trust in you and expect you do the same for us. Your money and finance have
    never been more secure than in Bunk Bank. Our recent studies show that merely
    just 12% of our users have been hacked and lost all their funds in the last 5
    years. Never have we felt more proud and confident about our security.


    Be
    a part of Bunk Bank!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0fa9194d9df0fd42a2638438732bb62, type: 2}
