  m_text: "Hello! This is Waldo and I will be your agent for Stocks App!\n\nStocks
    is an App that lets you invest in digital coins, which value change in time,
    so there is a 'high risk- high reward' kind of play involved. But worry not,
    the statistics have shown that great majority or investors come out ahead financially.
    \n\nAt the moment we have three coins which you can invest in. Each one is different
    in terms of how frequent its price changes, and how great the change in price
    is, so invest wisely. We do not provide investment advisory services (yet!),
    so all I can say now is happy investing and we hope our Stocks App brings you
    joy!"
