      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Yo! Did you hear about the diamonds in MTX, or like the feature to spend
    them? I heard it's a total scam cuz there ain't nothing in the shop you can buy
    with them and the drop rate is like less than 1%. Maybe theres like a secret
    feature or something idk. \n\nI knew a guy from school that played it and he
    also bought it, said you couldn't buy nothin with it. And some time later he
    like totally disappeared. No contact- real, mail or any kind. Didnt even open
    up the game anymore. And he was mad addicted to it. If you discover what them
    diamonds do, lemme know."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0fa9194d9df0fd42a2638438732bb62, type: 2}
